        "title": "Exact background-coupled RG comparison",
        "reference": "items/def-aqft-exact-background-rg-flow.md",
        "design_state": "A-page finite-regulator definition of an exact background-coupled Wilsonian comparison with fixed symmetry, background groupoid, field content, measure, and local-counterterm relation; no continuum existence claim.",
